add(71,[71,72],'idea of the earlier run',[45],'1422–1428','C²(O_C); de la normalisée',
 'For a reduced Cartier curve C in a smooth surface with normalization ν, 0→O_C→ν_*O_Ctilde→Q→0 gives c2(O_C)=c2(ν_*O_Ctilde)+[Q]=C². The page’s genus formula instead computes the normalization pushforward unless Q=0. For a rational nodal plane cubic it yields8 rather than9.', 'The replacement of O_C by ν_*O_Ctilde is a mathematical candidate requiring ink review; the defect correction and nodal test are the earlier run’s deductions.', 'agrees','The source really writes O_C while referring to the normalization; both notes concern this same defect and are merged.')
